[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m To find the fraction of 2 feet that is 3 inches, we need to convert both measurements to the same unit. Since 1 foot is equal to 12 inches, we can convert 2 feet to inches as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
