[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m In this case, the first term \( a_1 \) is 1, the common difference \( d \) is 2, and we need to find the term number \( n \) such that \( a_n = 2003 \).
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
