[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m Then, we divide both sides by 2:
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[ 1001 = n-1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
