[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot (\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}) = \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{a} - \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m We know that the angle between $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ is $29^\circ$, so:
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{a} = \|\mathbf{a}\|^2 = \cos^2 29^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} = \|\mathbf{a}\| \|\mathbf{b}\| \cos 29^\circ \cos 84^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m We also know that the angle between $\mathbf{b}$ and $\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}$ is $84^\circ$, so:
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{b} \cdot (\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}) = \mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m We know that the angle between $\mathbf{b}$ and $\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}$ is $84^\circ$, so:
