[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{a} = \|\mathbf{b}\| \|\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}\| \cos 84^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m Now, we can substitute these into the dot product formula:
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=506876)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot (\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}) = \|\mathbf{a}\|^2 - \|\mathbf{a}\| \|\mathbf{b}\| \cos 29^\circ \cos 84^\circ
